  "prefLabel": "Saf-C 3003.03 Procedure to Obtain A Hardship Registration",
  "priorExpiration": "2004-07-23",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Saf-C 3003.03 Procedure to Obtain A Hardship Registration.\n\n(a) A person whose privilege to register any motor vehicle has been suspended or revoked pursuant to RSA 261:180, III may obtain a hardship registration by mailing or by providing in person at the registration section of the department the following:\n\n(1) The motor vehicle registration form(s) for the vehicle(s) that are subject to suspension;\n\n(2) The notice or a copy thereof, sent by the department, indicating that the person's registration privileges are scheduled to be revoked and that a hardship registration is available; and\n\n(3) The $10 fee, pursuant to RSA 261:180, IV, for each registration converted to a hardship registration.\n\n(b) Upon receipt of the information set forth in (a) above, the department shall issue a hardship registration to the person.\n\nSource. #5027, eff 12-19-90; ss by #6296, eff 7-23-96; ss by #6296, eff 7-23-96, EXPIRED: 7-23-04\n\nNew. #8181, eff 9-25-04; ss by #10085, eff 1-31-12; ss by #13279, eff 10-19-21",
